# AgriGraph AI — Project Overview

## Data Contract
The real ICBF dataset lives at `backend/data/icbf_real.csv`.
Shape: 130 rows × 19 columns (county, year, 17 features).
Never regenerate or overwrite this file. Read-only.
The cleaned version is saved as `backend/data/icbf_clean.csv` by Phase A1.

## The 26 Irish Counties (exact strings used as keys everywhere)
Carlow, Cavan, Clare, Cork, Donegal, Dublin, Galway, Kerry, Kildare, Kilkenny,
Laois, Leitrim, Limerick, Longford, Louth, Mayo, Meath, Monaghan, Offaly,
Roscommon, Sligo, Tipperary, Waterford, Westmeath, Wexford, Wicklow

